        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Texas Tenors turn 15, come back to perform in Warren - thetexastenors"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Warren, OH – The Texas Tenors are celebrating its 15th anniversary this year, and Mahoning Valley audiences have been with the trio nearly every step of the way. Marcus Collins, JC Fisher and John Hagen started singing together to compete on the NBC reality competition series “America’s Got Talent.” The group finished fourth in 2009...Continue reading"
      }
    ],
