    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Bravo, Maestro! Aug 14 8 min read AN AUGUST 22 CELEBRATION AT TANGLEWOOD HERALDS KEITH LOCKHART’S 30 YEARS AS CONDUCTOR OF THE BOSTON POPS  By Anastasia Stanmeyer    Keith Lockhart (Marco Borggreve) On May 10, 1995, Keith Lockhart opened his very first Boston Pops season at Symphony Hall. He was only 35 years old and dubbed “The Kid” by longtime...Continue reading"
      }
